0..51 Comment "//! A rule cell counts each hole in its right side."
52..55 Comment "//!"
56..117 Comment "//! The count is the hole\'s Lipschitz constant under one step"
118..204 Comment "//! [Gavazzo-2022-quantitative_metric_rewriting_abstract_nonexpansive_graded_systems]."
205..208 Comment "//!"
209..283 Comment "//! `gandr cells` reports every count. The report does not refuse a count."
284..361 Comment "//! `mirror` is linear. `left` has count zero. `twice` and `thrice` duplicate"
362..378 Comment "//! their input."
379..382 Comment "//!"
383..399 Comment "//! - see: #2788"
400..494 Comment "//! - cites: [Gavazzo-2022-quantitative_metric_rewriting_abstract_nonexpansive_graded_systems]"
